## Flags for the node `bin/vigil start` boots. The name, the cookie and the
## distribution port come from rel/env.sh.eex.

## Distribution listens on loopback only, and without epmd: the node listens
## on the port rel/env.sh.eex passes as -erl_epmd_port, and nothing else is
## opened for it. Anything beyond loopback would reach around Cloudflare Access.
-start_epmd false
-kernel inet_dist_use_interface {127,0,0,1}
